# Google Play service account key for `eas submit` (created 2026-09-16).
# A PRIVATE KEY WITH RELEASE RIGHTS ON THE PLAY ACCOUNT. Never commit it.
# Google auto-disables service account keys it finds in public repositories,
# so a leak here costs a revoke-and-reissue, not just embarrassment.
credentials/
